Place app screenshots here (PNG, 1280x800 recommended — the app window size).

Expected filenames (referenced by README.md and README.ar.md):
  dashboard.png   — dashboard with KPIs, today's sessions, finance charts
  students.png    — students list / student profile with trends
  attendance.png  — daily attendance roster
  schedule.png    — weekly timetable grid
  payments.png    — payments dues + history
  expenses.png    — expenses table + category chart
  reports.png     — reports page with preview
  settings.png    — settings / appearance

Once added, they render automatically — no README edit needed.
